START

Display the Utility Bill Calculator heading.

Ask the customer for their account number.
Read the account number.

Ask the customer for their full name.
Read the full name.

Ask for the previous meter reading.
Read the previous reading.

Ask for the current meter reading.
Read the current reading.

Check the meter readings.

IF the current reading is less than the previous reading
Reject the readings.
Ask the customer to enter the readings again.
END IF

Calculate the total electricity consumption.

Set the base customer charge to $18.50.

Check the amount of electricity used.

IF the consumption is 500 kWh or less
Calculate the Tier 1 charge.

ELSE IF the consumption is 1000 kWh or less
Calculate the Tier 1 charge.
Calculate the Tier 2 charge.

ELSE
Calculate the Tier 1 charge.
Calculate the Tier 2 charge.
Calculate the Tier 3 charge.
END IF

Add the base charge and tier charges to get the subtotal.

Calculate the 5.5% Municipal Clean Energy Surcharge.

Add the surcharge to the subtotal to get the total balance.

Display the customer's information.

Display the tier charges, subtotal, surcharge, and total balance.

Display the payment due date.

END
